<title>HONG KONG: Indah Kiat Pulp sets $400 mln loan.</title>
<headline>Indah Kiat Pulp sets $400 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syndication of PT Indah Kiat Pulp and Paper Corp's US$400 million loan facility is expected to be completed in early April, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the mandated arrangers are BA Asia and Fuji Singapore.</p>
<p>The facility has a final maturity of five years with a put option in year three. The bullet loan pays an interest margin of 160 basis points over the Singapore Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>With fees, the all-in return for top-tier managers is 193 basis points.</p>
<p>Proceeds are to be used for refinancing previous debt.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
